@startuml payment-settlement-sequence
' Status: Draft. AI-generated; not human reviewed (Constitution Principle VII).
' Syntax not yet checked: PlantUML is not available on the authoring machine.
' Written design: specs/001-splitsmart-expense-sharing/contracts/service-contracts.md
title Payment Settlement (FR-030 to FR-033, FR-027; Draft)

actor "Payer" as Payer
participant "PaymentDialog\nPaymentController" as PaymentUi
participant PaymentService
participant AccessPolicy
participant BalanceService
participant BalanceLedger
participant TransactionManager
database Repositories

Payer -> PaymentUi : enter group, recipient, amount, date, optional note
PaymentUi -> PaymentService : recordPayment(actor, input, overpaymentConfirmed = false)
note right of PaymentUi : Runs off the EDT. The UI does not compare amounts.
PaymentService -> PaymentService : validate fields (FR-030)
alt any field invalid, including missing group
  PaymentService --> PaymentUi : ValidationException
  PaymentUi --> Payer : mark fields; keep entered data
else valid
  PaymentService -> AccessPolicy : requireMember for actor and recipient
  PaymentService -> TransactionManager : inTransaction
  activate TransactionManager
  PaymentService -> BalanceService : owedInGroup(groupId, payer, recipient)
  BalanceService -> Repositories : APPROVED expenses and payments in the group
  BalanceService -> BalanceLedger : from(records).net(recipient, payer)
  BalanceLedger --> BalanceService : net
  BalanceService --> PaymentService : amount owed (0 or more)
  alt amount exceeds owed and not confirmed (FR-032)
    PaymentService --> PaymentUi : OverpaymentConfirmationRequiredException(owed, entered)
    deactivate TransactionManager
    PaymentUi --> Payer : warn; Cancel is the default
    alt payer confirms
      PaymentUi -> PaymentService : recordPayment(actor, input, overpaymentConfirmed = true)
      note right of PaymentService
        Repeats the same flow.
        Amount owed is rechecked in a new transaction.
      end note
    else payer cancels
      PaymentUi --> Payer : nothing is saved
    end
  else within owed, or confirmed
    PaymentService -> Repositories : insert immutable Payment (NFR-006)
    note right of Repositories
      FR-031: applies at once; no recipient confirmation.
      Balance changes because it is derived from this record.
      No other group's balance changes.
    end note
    PaymentService --> PaymentUi : PaymentView
    PaymentUi --> Payer : recorded; visible to payer and recipient (FR-033)
  end
end

@enduml
